  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>At any instant of time, the length of the string wrapped on the pulley is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R&#952;</mi></math>&nbsp;and the remaining length&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>R&#952;</mi></math></p><p>The rate <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mfrac><mi>d&#952;</mi><mi>dt</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>R&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>R&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math>, where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></math>&nbsp;is the speed of the particle</p><p>The height through which the particle has come down</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>R&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>sin&#952;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>R&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>sin&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>R&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>R&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>sin&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></math></p>",
